Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:56.02,EDCN2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,330,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(6232,6580,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}在我面前  你总是很温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:23:02.63,EDCN2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,324,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(5242,5570,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}但那份温柔  却让我不安
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.83,0:23:11.48,EDCN2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,313,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(6403,6650,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}为了让命运的红线  不要被解开
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.49,0:23:17.83,EDCN2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,247,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(4992,5340,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}我无数次将它重新系起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.26,0:23:26.64,EDCN2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,346,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(7166,7380,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}下一次见面的约定  还没有做好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:36.28,EDCN2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\blur12\t(0,262,\alpha&H00&\blur0)\t(8057,8360,\alpha&HFF&\blur12)}离别的话语  我还不想听到
