Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:30.55,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(365.333,201.333)}所以也无从下手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:30.55,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(505.333,204)}因为不在那里、
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:30.55,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(808,204)}找不到的东西、
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:30.55,title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(1138.667,342.666)}第十五页
